// Copy to Local.xcconfig (untracked) and fill in.
//
// Keeps account-specific settings out of the Xcode project, so opening this in
// Xcode and picking a team does not write that team back into a tracked file.
//
// Not a secret: the Team ID is embedded in every Developer ID signature and can
// be read from any released build with `codesign -dv`.

// security find-identity -v -p codesigning | grep 'Developer ID Application'
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
